patch 1
owner skein 1

# every 1 to 2: every derived change, a written declaration (Shape) and a
# written field (Every.score), for codec.md 11.8's story.
family every 1 to 2
versioned Blank
rename Numbers.wait pause
rename Strings Texts
widen Texts.raw bytes 6 bytes 8
add Light.off
add Stamp.zone text 8 "utc"
add Shape.blank
drop Shape.dot
written Shape
widen Nest.grid list 2 list 2 u16 list 2 list 2 u32
add Nest.label option text 8 some "nest"
drop Nest.pairs
wrap Every.light Light option Light
add Every.score u32 written
order Every numbers strings light shape stamp empty nest held items
written Every.score
